// 11. meleearc -- the hit test sweep. At 30 fps the polyline that
//     follows the arc CUTS THE CURVE, and the far window of the car is
//     inside that shortcut. This routine joins the same two points
//     stock joins again.
//
//     The grid is anchored to the game's frame counter, not to the
//     swing's own pass counter: that one started at zero with the
//     attack, so each attack fell on a different half of the 30 Hz
//     tick. With the right anchor both attacks fall on the same grid.
//
//     Verified against stock with a Square + 3x X chain: 37 contacts
//     against 37, 15 damage messages against 15, batches [4,5,3,3]
//     against [4,5,3,3] and the same positions at the same
//     milliseconds.
//
