//
//     and only now the hook, a `j` WITHOUT its delay slot: the
//     `mfc1 $a1, $f12` runs live before the jump and is the t the lerp
//     hands to the VU. The routine replays the displaced `lq` FIRST and
//     returns to 0x00336BC8. Section 43's `j` lands on this one.
patch=1,EE,00336BC0,word,0803A000

// 45. flamerate -- FLAMES run at double speed. The flames behind the
//     station after the Tremont card, and the fire in Virgil's arena.
//
//     The symptom: the four flame classes (part_narrowflame and
//     part_squareflame_lrg/med/sml) share the update 0x003C87A0, which
//     advances ONE frame of the atlas per call, without dt, and wraps
//     to zero at 36. At 60 fps there is one call per frame and the
//     cycle lasted half as long: 600 ms instead of 1201.
//
//     This section, with dt 1/60 and live divider 1: it skips the
//     increment on EVEN world substeps ([0x005104F4]) and keeps it on
//     the ODD ones, which is stock's cadence and phase. The comparison
//     against 36, the wrap, the write and the publication go on through
//     the native path: on the held substep the same index is published
//     again. Outside those conditions, native behaviour. It DEPENDS on
//     section 4 (`quantum`). It preserves the 128-bit $t0/$t1; no
//     mutable state. Barrels and torches (part_fire*, 0x003CA138) are
//     another family and are not touched. The routine, in its cave:
//
//       0x000E8400  24030024  addiu $v1, $zero, 36
//       0x000E8404  27BDFFE0  addiu $sp, $sp, -32
//       0x000E8408  7FA80000  sq    $t0, 0($sp)
//       0x000E840C  7FA90010  sq    $t1, 16($sp)
//       0x000E8410  3C080051  lui   $t0, 0x0051
//       0x000E8414  350802CC  ori   $t0, $t0, 716
//       0x000E8418  8D080000  lw    $t0, 0($t0)
//       0x000E841C  3C093C88  lui   $t1, 0x3C88
//       0x000E8420  35298889  ori   $t1, $t1, -30583
//       0x000E8424  15090012  bne   $t0, $t1, 0x000E8470
//       0x000E8428  00000000  nop
//       0x000E842C  3C080059  lui   $t0, 0x0059
