//
//     and only now the hook, a `j` WITHOUT its delay slot: the
//     `lw $v0, 0($a1)` loads the counter before the jump. The routine
//     replays the displaced `addiu $v1, $zero, 36` FIRST and returns to
//     0x003C87D0 (advance) or to 0x003C87D4 (hold).
